              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ino nkaambonzi tulikede buyo? Amuyoboloke, twiinke kuminzi iili amabaya, tukalobele nkuko, nkaambo kuloba ncencico Jehova Leza wesu ncatubikila, Watunywisya maanzi aali ancefu, nkaambo twabisizya Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.14",
